# Round 5: forced wild cards. A chemist's offer on every arrival, a free find on every arrival, a
# crew offer whenever the stash is big, and the crew never overdoses: back a chemical, take a find,
# take the crew deal and get paid, then watch the stakes resolve.
@seed 33
@param rc_offer_permille=1000
@param rc_find_permille=1000
@param cohort_offer_permille=1000
@param cohort_od_permille=0
D A L1 L START A
# ride to Midtown: three cards, the second is the chemist
R1 R1 A D A
A
@shot chemist-card
# BACK IT: the stake dial, $500
A L L U U U U U
@shot stake-dial
A
@shot find-card
A
# buy Weed with the cash that is left (a stash worth at least $5,000 at mid prices draws the crew)
R1 A Y A
# ride to Deep Deuce: the crew offers
R1 R1 A D A
A A
@shot crew-card
# DO IT: the crew pays
A
@shot crew-paid
A A
# two more rides: the stakes come due on day five
A D A
A A
A D A
A A
@shot stake-bust
A
@shot stake-hit
A A
@shot chemist-again
# walk away from the next chemist, then the find, back at the market
B
@shot find-again
A
@shot after-pass
